The '''Wednesday Blitz Stage''' or '''Wednesday Guerrilla Stage''' (ゲリラ水曜ステージ ''Gerira Suiyō Sutēji'') is a harder version of the regular [[Wednesday Stage]]s. Each time the player beats this stage, they will be rewarded a [[Battle Items#Cat Jobs|Cat Jobs]].

