==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6~18 seconds<sup>180f~540f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3~12 seconds<sup>90f~360f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Dark Cat]]/[[Crazed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Brave Cat]]. [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]] and other anti-Red [[:Category:Gacha Cats|Gacha Cats]] will be super helpful here. The buffed Bore can be annoying, but you just need to meatshield!

Alternatively, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]].

